#: app/crash.py:43
msgid "程序遇到未处理的错误。操作可以继续，但请查看日志。"
msgstr ""
"The program hit an unhandled error. You can keep going, but please check "
"the log."

#: app/crash.py:44
msgid "日志文件"
msgstr "Log file"

#: app/crash.py:59
