#: app/ui/main_window.py:339
msgid ""
"这是一个包含国际化、日志、异常捕获与打包流程的 PySide6 起点工程。\n"
"标题栏的语言图标切界面语言、外观图标切深浅主题，最左侧的图标是应用菜单；选择都会持久化到用户目录。"
msgstr ""
"A PySide6 starting point with internationalization, logging, crash "
"capture and\n"
"packaging. In the title bar, the globe icon switches the UI language, the"
" sun/moon\n"
"icon switches between light and dark, and the leftmost icon is the app "
"menu; all\n"
"choices are saved per user."

